#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:77
msgid ""
"Every Japanese ticket is a <b>campaign</b>, not a date — fan-club "
"presale, lottery\n"
"      round 1, round 2 if you lose, a first-come sale, an upgrade round "
"riding on the\n"
"      seat you already hold. We track the whole ladder and tell you "
"exactly where you stand."
msgstr ""
"购买日本的门票通常要经过<b>多个阶段</b>，例如 FC "
"先行、第一轮抽选、落选后的下一轮抽选、先到先得发售，以及已持有门票的升级抽选。我们会跟踪每个阶段，并告诉你下一步是什么。"

#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:83
msgid "Free · we DM you on Discord · no card, no spam"
msgstr "免费 · 我们会通过 Discord 给你发 DM · 无需绑卡，绝不骚扰"

#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:86
