"Tap a franchise, a group, or one performer. New events for anyone you "
"follow\n"
"          show up on your board <b>automatically</b>."
msgstr "点选一个系列、一个组合或一位出演者。你所关注对象的新活动会<b>自动</b>出现在看板上。"

#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:104
msgid "We track every round's deadline"
msgstr "我们追踪每个轮次的截止时间"

#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:105
msgid ""
"Presale opens, lottery closes, results land, payment is due. All times "
"shown\n"
"          <b>JST and yours</b>, always both — no mental arithmetic at 3am."
msgstr "你可以查看先行开始、抽选截止、结果公布和付款截止时间。所有时间都会同时以<b>JST 和你的当地时间</b>显示。"

#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:110
